                <div type="textpart" subtype="incipit" xml:lang="gez">
                    <note>The following incipit is taken from <ref type="mss" corresp="https://betamasaheft.eu/EMIP00289">Portland, Ethiopic Manuscript Imaging Project, Marquart Codex</ref>.</note>
                <ab>
                    <hi rend="rubric">ሃሌ፡ ሃሌያ፡ ሉያ፡ መፍቅሬ፡ ጸሎ</hi>ት፡ ወጾም፡ ኮከበ፡ ገዳም፡ ገብረ፡ መንፈስ፡ ቅዱስ፡ ዕንቈ፡ ሶም፡ ሰላም፡ ለከ፡ ሰላም<hi rend="rubric">። ሃ</hi>ለ፡ ብእሲ፡ ጊጉይ፡ ድኅረ፡ 
                        ንስሐሁ፡ ዘሰረይከ፡ ሎቱ፡ ከማሁ፡ አባ፡ አበሳሁ፡ ስረይ፡ ሊተ፡ <sic>ከከማሁ</sic>። 
                </ab>
              </div>
                <div type="textpart" subtype="explicit" xml:lang="gez">
                    <note>The following incipit is taken from <ref type="mss" corresp="https://betamasaheft.eu/EMIP00289">Portland, Ethiopic Manuscript Imaging Project, Marquart Codex</ref>.</note>
                    <ab>ሰብእ፡ ደቂቅ፡ ውስተ፡ እግረ፡ ጸድፍ፡ ዘተዋነዬ፡ ስብሐቲከ፡ ከመ፡ ርእዩ፡ አሕዩ፡ ለአርዌ፡ ቀይሕ፡ እምከዩ።
